   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT in relation to authorizing the Onondaga County Sheriff's Department, in\nthe county of Onondaga, to offer the optional twenty year retirement plan to\ndeputy sheriffs Brittany E. Dorn, Noah C. Hunt, Daniel D. Lorenzini, Gordon J.\nLopez, Tre C. Fesinger, Christopher L. Van Dusen",
    "basePrintNo": "S7384",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7384-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Retirement",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S7384\n\nSPONSOR: RYAN C\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act in relation to authorizing the Onondaga County Sheriff's Depart-\nment, in the county of Onondaga, to offer the optional twenty year\nretirement plan to deputy sheriffs Brittany E. Dorn, Noah C. Hunt,\nDaniel D. Lorenzini, Gordon J.  Lopez, Tre C. Fesinger, Christopher L.\nVan Dusen\n\n \nPURPOSE OF THE BILL:\n\nTo correct a clerical error and allow Onondaga County deputy sheriffs\nBrittany E. Dorn, Noah C. Hunt, Daniel D.  Lorenzini, Gordon J. Lopez,\nTre C. Fesinger, Christopher L. Van Dusen to join the twenty-year\nretirement plan.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: Authorizes Onondaga County to offer deputy sheriffs Brittany\nE. Dorn, Noah C. Hunt, Daniel D. Lorenzini, Gordon J. Lopez, Tre C.\nFesinger, Christopher L. Van Dusen membership in the twenty-year retire-\nment plan to correct an error made when they first joined the pension\nsystem.\n\nSection 2: Establishes the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nWhen deputy sheriffs Brittany E. Dorn, Noah C. Hunt, Daniel D.  Lorenzi-\nni, Gordon J. Lopez, Tre C. Fesinger, Christopher L. Van Dusen joined\nthe Onondaga County Sheriff's Department an error was made where they\nwere not put into the twenty-year retirement plan for law enforcement.\nThis was a clerical error. Legislation is now needed to allow these\ndeputies to join the twenty-year retirement plan.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nSee attached Fiscal Note.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately.\n",
